        "mind",
        "off",
        "of",
        "you"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 81.98,
      "end": 83.71,
      "text": "And it's all because",
      "words": [
        "And",
        "it's",
        "all",
        "because"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 83.81,
      "end": 87.07,
      "text": "I see the galaxies when I look in your eyes",
      "words": [
        "I",
        "see",
        "the",
        "galaxies",
        "when",
        "I",
        "look",
        "in",
        "your",
        "eyes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 87.17,
      "end": 91.7,
      "text": "And I, can't speak, no, I, can't speak at all",
      "words": [
        "And",
        "I",
        "can't",
        "speak",
        "no",
        "I",
        "can't",
        "speak",
        "at",
        "all"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 91.8,
      "end": 95.45,
      "text": "I swear to Zeus, you're Aphrodite in disguise",
